{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_012XFf1NadbCMbdpvUDcPCkR","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# GWL t2r Harness — to GA — Execution Log\n2\t\n3\tForeman records per-wave build outcomes below. 8 wave(s) planned.\n4\t\n5\t## Waves\n6\t\n7\t| Wave | Title | Outcome | Gate | Commit |\n8\t|---|---|---|---|---|\n9\t| 1 | Foundation: land the held branch | ✅ GREEN | — | `fcce2ed2` |\n10\t| 2 | F5 cache-warmth data-gate tooling + decision | ✅ GREEN | 93/93 | `dce2884f` |\n11\t| 3 | Cutover + soak | ✅ GREEN | 101/101 | `be0076af` |\n12\t| 4 | Capability-gap audit + code-alpha | ✅ GREEN | 120/120 | `00599167` |\n13\t| 5 | research-alpha | ✅ GREEN | 123/123 | `234b0fb0` |\n14\t| 6 | D1 Concurrent multi-agent harness | ✅ GREEN | 128/128 | `fa0347bf` |\n15\t| 7 | D2 Write-tool fleet + supervisor + read_raw | ✅ GREEN | 146/146 | `b2c3ccba` |\n16\t| 8 | D3 Moving history breakpoint | ✅ GREEN | 154/154 | `ffbcffd6` |\n17\t\n18\t**PROJECT DONE** — the terminal wave (8) is GREEN via the orchestrator-run gate. The\n19\tGWL harness is at GA for the google+anthropic scope on the Opus-4.8 baseline brain.\n20\t\n21\t### Notes\n22\t- Waves 2–6 were driven autonomously (commits above). The run HALTED mid-Wave-7 when\n23\t  the live driver's reviewer sub-agent returned unparseable JSON twice and Foreman\n24\t  correctly ABSTAINED rather than drop a possibly-real finding.\n25\t- Waves 7 & 8 were completed under Foreman's discipline with the orchestrator gate as\n26\t  the truth of record: EXECUTE → orchestrator GATE (`node --test gwl-t2r-brain/harness/*.test.mjs`)\n27\t  → 2 fresh independent adversarial reviewers (BLOCKER needs ≥2 to agree) → commit-on-GO.\n28\t  Both waves: 2/2 reviewers GO, no findings.\n29\t- Rollback seam preserved throughout (every new capability is per-agent, default-OFF;\n30\t  the wire is byte-identical when disabled).\n31\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01R7onNqhV8BYzhXq32rMA1B","session_id":"75eda862-34e1-4a42-a5f6-73eb4ef1