families\" and they are not the same family. The Cultural Comparison Tarea 4 will ask the student to specify *which* Hispanic family is being compared.\nC:\\dev\\Agentic-Home/Curriculum/high/grade-10/AP-Latin-or-AP-Spanish-French-Lang/student/readings/latin-grammar.md:The relative pronoun has the same declension as the **interrogative** adjective *quī, quae, quod* (and the interrogative pronoun *quis, quid* in the same family). Memorize it cold:\nC:\\dev\\Agentic-Home/Curriculum/high/grade-12/AP-English-Literature-and-Composition/student/units/UNIT-07-20th-Century-American.md:The teaching move: read the two sections as two ways the same family's story can be told. Each interior emphasizes different elements; each is incomplete; together they begin to compose what the novel is about — the dissolution of the Compson family across the 20th century.\nC:\\dev\\Agentic-Home/Curriculum/high/grade-12/AP-Statistics/student/units/UNIT-10-Bayesian-Inference.md:The Bayesian answer is procedurally simple in the **conjugate** case (when the prior and the likelihood combine to give a posterior in the same family as the prior). For the proportion-of-successes parameter p with binomial data, the conjugate prior is the **Beta distribution**, and the math is unusually clean.\nC:\\dev\\Agentic-Home/Curriculum/high/grade-12/Character-12-Phronesis-and-the-Constitution/student/units/UNIT-01-The-Senior-Year-Frame.md:The remainder of the Declaration is, by word count, much longer. It is the *bill of particulars* — the twenty-seven specific grievances against George III. *He has refused his Assent to Laws ... He has called together legislative bodies at places unusual, uncomfortable, and distant ... He has dissolved Representative Houses repeatedly ... He has erected a multitude of New Offices, and sent hither swarms of Officers to harass our people ... He has kept among us, in times of peace, Standing Armies without the Consent of our legislatures ...* The grievances are concrete, numbered, dated, particular. They are the kind of evidence a court might enter into the record. They are not timeless; they are specific to the period 1763-1776.\nC:\\dev\\Agentic-Home/Curriculum/middle/grade-6/Literature-Iliad-Odyssey/teacher/ANSWER-KEYS/UNITS-02-08-keys.md:**5.3.** Five *poly-* compounds: *polytropos* (of many turns), *polymētis* (of many counsels), *polymēchanos* (of many devices), *polytlas* (much-suffering), *polyphlōisbos* (loud-roaring — applied to the sea, not Odysseus, but the *poly-* compound is in the same family).\nC:\\dev\\Agentic-Home/Curriculum/skill-library/apenglit-12/apenglit-12-u07-l7-1-the-american-20th-century.skill.md:The teaching move: read the two sections as two ways the same family's story can be told. Each interior emphasizes different elements; each is incomplete; together they begin to compose what the novel is about — the dissolution of the Compson family across the 20th century.\nC:\\dev\\Agentic-Home/Curriculum/skill-library/apstat-12/apstat-12-u10-l10-2-the-beta-binomial-conjugate-update.skill.md:The Bayesian answer is procedurally simple in the **conjugate** case (when the prior and the likelihood combine to give a posterior in the same family as the prior). For the proportion-of-successes parameter p with binomial data, the conjugate prior is the **Beta distribution**, and the math is unusually clean.\nC:\\dev\\Agentic-Home/docs/findings/FINDINGS-Aurora-Pricing-and-Local-Tier-2026-05-25.md:  same-family header (so Opus 4.7's window can't reach Opus 4.1's price). Wired the\nC:\\dev\\Agentic-Home/docs/plans/GRASSCATCHER-t2r-harness.md:| 5 | **GWL agents drive sub-agent swarms + the research→plan→build trio via a `-p`-style headless spawn** | The harness already has the *concurrency primitive* (Wave 6 D1 concurrent multi-agent + Wave 7 spawn-budget / child-ledger / depth-guard / forget-boundary), but a GWL agent can't yet *fan out its own swarm* (Swarm-Sandwich) or *drive the researchPrime→Crucible→Foreman trio* as headless `-p` sub-invocations. This is an additive harness feature on top of the landed concurrency layer — own subproject, don't balloon Phase A–D. | **Pick up as a dedicated harness build AFTER the `t2r-harness-to-GA` handoff reaches GA** (and likely after, or in parallel with, the `t2r-brain` Phase E). Scope: a `-p`/headless spawn surface + a swarm/trio driver that reuses the existing spawn-budget + child-ledger + depth-guard machinery. Added per John, 2026-06-10. |","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01R7onNqhV8BYzhXq32rMA1B","session_id":"75eda862-34e1-4a42-a5f6-73eb4ef1cd9a","uuid":"b380a03e-c643-42ff-8b40-3299f74fa3a5","timestamp":"2026-06-23T18:18:03.995Z","subagent_type":"Explore","task_description":"Ground Gandalf diagnosis of Agentic-Home"}
